<title>SWEDEN: Banks take up Boliden option-Trelleborg. [CORRECTED 15:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Banks take up Boliden option-Trelleborg. [CORRECTED 15:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish metals and rubber group Trelleborg said on Thursday that banks participating in the Toronto listing of mining unit Boliden Ltd had decided to exercise an option to buy a further 4.1 million Boliden shares. (Corrects statement throughout.)</p>
</text>
